[00:35.04]1. Come share in the work of our Master;
[00:40.24]Respond to his call and obey.
[00:45.96]He offers to help and to guide you;
[00:51.76]His teaching will show you the way.
[00:58.03]The seed of the truth has power to grow
[01:03.63]In hearts that are honest and true.
[01:09.03]So give of your best as you faithfully share
[01:14.83]In the work you’ve been given to do.
[01:30.81]2. How much of your work is successful
[01:35.23]May often depend much on you.
[01:40.23]Those hearing will need your assistance
[01:46.23]To learn and to love what is true.
[01:52.32]So help them to deal with pressures and doubts
[01:58.32]They’re certain to face on their way.
[02:03.32]The seed of the truth will bring joy when you see
[02:08.32]How it grows in their heart day by day.